Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root. It is the authoritative contributor guide for
this repo: skill layout, frontmatter rules, validation commands, and installer behavior.

Before finishing any change run:

```bash
python3 scripts/validate.py
python3 scripts/install.py --all --dry-run
```
